AnnexKit collector — GNU AGPL-3.0
=================================

The AnnexKit runtime collector in this directory (backend + frontend) is
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.0. The full
canonical text is in:

  * apps/annexkit/backend/LICENSE
  * apps/annexkit/frontend/LICENSE

The collector imports the shared engine at ../../core (konformia-core), which
is also AGPL-3.0 — so the combined open-source work is consistent copyleft.

This is one package in an open-core monorepo. For the complete licensing map
(SDK = MIT, core + collector = AGPL-3.0, Konformia platform = proprietary) and
the dual-licensing rationale, see LICENSING.md at the repository root.
